    <!-- Harbour. Deep water with a far shore and three lamps on it. The night set had a sky
         (Midnight), open water (Ocean), weather (Rain), warmth (Ember) and emptiness (Slate),
         and no card with any sign of another person in it. At 3am that is a different feeling
         from all five, which is the only reason to draw another dark card. -->
    <color name="widget_harbour_start">#16303F</color>
    <color name="widget_harbour_end">#060D14</color>
    <color name="widget_harbour_glow">#2EA8C4D8</color>
    <color name="widget_harbour_shore">#B30D1822</color>
    <color name="widget_harbour_light">#CCFFD28E</color>
    <color name="widget_harbour_reflection">#59FFD28E</color>

